WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.490
Someone once said...

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:54.960
In a sea of soup stock where the 
best oden ingredients float,

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:01.160
there are penguins with bodies made 
of first-rate, fluffy hanpen...

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:05.930
Hanpenguins!

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.240
There are swans with 
exquisite banana feathers

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:13.410
and heads of the best quality eggplant...

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:18.550
Bananaswan Eggplant!

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.080
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:27.150
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:32.530
The IGO President, Ichiryu, 
sent Toriko and Komatsu

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.890
to get another training 
ingredient, Bubble Fruit.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.060
They made their way through the Lost Forest,

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:40.230
but the end of the Fortune Roll was scooped 
away along with a chunk of the forest.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:43.500
Toriko and Komatsu chased after 
Chirin, a possible suspect.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:48.170
That led them to the legendary 
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:48.170
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.480
Chiru, the master chef of the restaurant,

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.310
told Toriko and Komatsu that Bubble 
Fruit is in the Chowlin Temple.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:59.990
But a customer of the restaurant is Chin 
Chin-Chin, master of Chowlin Temple!

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:07.160
People Without Gratitude Aren't 
Welcome! Terrifying Chowlin Temple!

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:11.630
T-This person is...

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.930
...the master of Chowlin Temple?!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:19.100
And one of the four Gourmet 
National Treasures in the world?!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.440
Honor the Food

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.440
Chin Chin-Chin!

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:28.710
Chin Chin-Chin, Master of Chowlin Temple

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:28.710
I am indeed Chin Chin-Chin.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:30.920
That's got a certain ring to it.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.420
Toshio and Kosugi...

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.390
Um, those aren't our names...

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.820
It's Toriko and Komatsu!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:42.330
I've heard about you two from 
the IGO President, Ryuichi.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:44.260
Really?!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:47.130
Except the old man's name is Ichiryu.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.940
C-Chiru-san, you know the 
master of Chowlin Temple?!

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:58.340
Yes. When I was a child, I learned 
Gourmet Etiquette from the master.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:02.780
Chirin, you should also go 
to the temple for training.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.450
Nah. Thanks, but I'll pass.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.450
I hear it's really strict there.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:13.620
So you learned your delicate cooking 
techniques at Chowlin Temple, Chirin-san?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.860
I want to learn them, too!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.890
Then this is perfect!

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.660
Apparently, the old man already 
told him what we're after.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.900
Sounds like getting this ingredient 
will be smooth sailing!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.810
Smooth sailing?

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.940
Follow me, Tommy and Kotani.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.010
You're still getting our names wrong...

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.980
Toriko-sama, Komatsu-sama...

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:45.120
By all means, please stop 
here again on your way home.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:49.690
I'm sure you'll be able to eat this 
restaurant's entire full course by then.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.590
Thank you.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.230
We'll definitely stop by.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.460
We'll be back soon.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.100
That is, <i>if</i> you can make it back soon...

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.340
Good timing. You can accompany them there.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.570
I don't wanna go! I don't 
wanna! I don't wanna!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.980
By the way, Chiro...

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.910
It's Chiru.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:14.880
Granny Chiyo still hasn't come back?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:24.960
No.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.730
Unfortunately, the former 
master chef is still gone.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.330
What on earth could have become 
of someone like Granny Chiyo?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:37.200
Inform me immediately upon her return.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:43.880
I want to eat Granny Chiyo's food again.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.450
U-Um...

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.520
What is it, Konishi?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.720
I-It's Komatsu...

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:00.360
C-Could it be that the Chiyo-san 
you referred to before is...

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.730
Yes.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.200
The first master chef of 
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine,

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.770
Delicate Cooking Chiyo.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.140
I-I knew it...

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:14.340
The chef who was paid 100 million 
yen for every cut of her knife...

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:20.150
She was a genius, on a par with Gourmet 
National Treasure Setsuno-san!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:24.880
She was always in the top five 
of the chef rankings, too.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.150
I heard that with her overpowering charisma,

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:30.160
she had passionate disciples 
all over the world.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:34.790
But I believe her name and ranking 
dropped off the chart a few years ago.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.000
And speaking of chef ranking,

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.570
I wonder how Take-chan is doing these days.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:47.840
Granny Chiyo suddenly vanished 
one day, without a trace.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.980
No one knows the cause.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.650
But since then,

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:59.120
the number of chefs disappearing 
worldwide has risen precipitously.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.490
Could it be...?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.460
Don't tell me she was kidnapped?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.020
That's a hard pill to swallow.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.730
Granny Chiyo's skills were so formidable

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:12.930
that she was originally an assistant 
instructor at Chowlin Temple.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.370
Incidentally, she was my partner.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.610
So she's not so weak that 
they'd be able to kidnap her.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:25.040
Chiyo-san was your partner, Master?

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.980
Yes, well...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.920
But more importantly, Tominaga and Kojima...

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:35.080
Those names aren't even close.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:38.090
You'd best watch your step.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.520
Watch our step?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.360
Hey!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.760
What the hell is this?!

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.030
The ground has disappeared!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.130
The Disappearing Forest...

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.130
It's a forest with grass, 
trees, and dirt formed

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.870
out of the same materials as 
Vanishing Japanese Cuisine.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:59.340
Well, you did make a mess in the forest 
eating that giant Fortune Roll.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:04.810
So perhaps this forest is invisible 
to rude fellows like you.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.850
Wait, are you the one who 
took away our Fortune Roll?!

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:12.650
Indeed. The Fortune Roll 
itself was quite tasty.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.160
You know, I couldn't get 
enough of that Madam Fish.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:19.990
The Durian Bomb reeked to high 
heaven but it was wonderful, too.

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:23.200
Wait a second! Then you scooped 
out part of the forest, too?!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.770
Toriko-san, maybe the forest was there,

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.300
but we just couldn't see it!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.570
Try to see it now.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:38.150
Look at the scenery before your eyes with 
a gaze full of gratitude and respect.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.280
C-Come on, gratitude and respect?!

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.820
Put your hands together. And then bow.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.590
Put your hands together, 
Toriko-san! And be thankful...

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.090
You may be able to see it.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.930
The place you were looking for...

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.670
Grat...itude!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.240
Chowlin Temple

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.880
T-This is...

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:13.810
I don't believe it!

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.920
So you can finally see it...

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:23.320
Welcome to Chowlin Temple, 
the temple of Food Etiquette.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.860
T-This is Chowlin Temple?!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.090
We were already here?!

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:30.060
Just like with Vanishing Japanese Cuisine...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.260
A temple made of invisible materials!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.140
It's more than just being invisible...

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.800
Come closer and you'll understand.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.280
But I remind you to always keep 
etiquette in mind going forth.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:44.880
Etiquette?

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.850
Display gratitude and respect.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.750
That's what I mean by etiquette, 
Tonkichi and Kohinata.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.150
The names are getting farther off the mark...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.750
I'd say that's a lack of 
etiquette right there.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.360
Well, anyway, we arrived here safely.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.130
Yep. You're right about that.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:04.760
Now let's just grab the Bubble Fruit and go!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.030
What the...?!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.340
Komatsu!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.010
What was that?!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.280
Well, well. So soon?

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.790
Toriko-san!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.720
Fork Shield!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:38.090
Spiked Punch!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.000
W-What is this?!

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:50.370
I told you not to forget etiquette!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:54.280
My building here,

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:58.410
its materials aren't so shy around strangers 
that they conceal their appearance.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.250
Sometimes they also attack 
people who are rude.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:07.320
The materials are quite unforgiving.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.730
Attack?!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.360
Hot! Hot!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.630
I can't take it!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.530
I'm quitting this hellish temple!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.870
Hey, wait!

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.240
Master, it's terrible! The temple!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.940
It lost its temper at a rude 
person and burst into flames!

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:24.940
Hot!

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.510
It's on fire!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:31.280
This is too dangerous!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:34.520
At this rate, the Bubble 
Fruit will burn up, too!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.920
Alright! I'll handle this somehow!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.360
Spiked Punch!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:51.900
You did it, Toriko-san!

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.280
Oh, boy. You leave me no choice.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:20.890
Spoon!

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.640
Spoon!

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:42.780
There!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.030
You see? The fire is out!

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:09.010
Y-You scooped up the flames?!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:13.010
Well, I don't expect you to do this much.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:15.150
But unless you master the art

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:18.880
Chowlin Temple

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:18.880
of Honoring the Food, you won't even 
be able to touch the Bubble Fruit.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.820
I forgot...

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.120
One of the old man's training 
ingredients is here.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.190
Looks like it's not gonna 
be an easy job after all.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.000
The temple's attacking!

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.000
Knife!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:49.480
Oh, my. You two have no 
etiquette at all, do you...

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:53.480
You'll never be able to enter 
the main hall at this rate.

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.650
How the hell are we supposed 
to show etiquette?!

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.420
I already put my hands together 
and bowed plenty of times,

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.360
but it keeps attackin'!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.800
Well, I'll tell you, Tomato...

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.160
It's Toriko, not Tomato!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.830
Your actions are correct,

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.070
but there's no heart in it.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.670
What are you talkin' about?! 
There's heart in this!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:21.410
The premise of Honor the Food is 
based on the existence of the heart.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.850
When you visit a shrine, 
you pray sincerely then,

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:30.620
but the moment it's over, the 
feeling weakens, doesn't it?

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.820
Gratitude and respect for all things...

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:39.560
Never forgetting that feeling, 
even for a moment...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.430
That is the fundamental 
mindset to Honor the Food.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:44.670
Always feel gratitude...

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.810
I-It worked!

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:01.480
Even without putting our 
hands together and bowing!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:02.880
It stopped attacking!

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:07.920
Jeez! That was actually simple, Komatsu!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:12.360
Toriko-san!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.300
Are you okay, Toriko-san?!

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:20.430
I think this is going to take some time...

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.870
Listen, you two...

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:27.640
Appreciating food is the same 
thing as appreciating life.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:31.280
By that, I mean your own life 
but also all life, everywhere.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:36.780
Being grateful towards all things is 
the foundation of Honoring the Food.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:41.650
Always displaying respect for 
everything seriously and sincerely...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:46.590
Are you listening to me?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.200
Y-Yes, I'm listening!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.100
I'm concentrating!

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:52.870
I'm totally appreciative!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:57.970
Very good. This is the 
place where you learn that.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:06.810
Hands together!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.480
Bow!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.150
Thank you for the food!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.950
A-Are all of these people 
students of Chowlin Temple?!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.790
That's correct.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.460
We have many students who want 
to study Honoring the Food.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:22.960
100,000 people every year, 
from children to adults...

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.830
O-One hundred-thousand people?!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.300
Most of them join

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:32.000
Chowlin Temple branches all over the 
world and study Honoring the Food there.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:38.310
But the headquarters here is the 
harshest training ground in the world.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.880
T-This is the harshest?

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:45.080
Still, all of these people here 
shows there must be a lot to learn.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:49.250
I wouldn't think many people could 
find their way through that forest.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:54.320
Well, these folks are criminals who 
were brought here against their will.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.130
Criminals?!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.890
Hey, are you serious?!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.630
Take Honey Prison, for example...

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:04.970
It's the end of the line for gourmet 
criminals, and they're forbidden to leave,

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:08.870
but this is a place where they can 
relearn how to Honor the Food.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.910
If they complete the training 
successfully, they're released.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:18.480
But most of them can't withstand the 
severe training and flee the temple.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.580
Incidentally, those that do fly the coop

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:23.790
never do make it through the sea of trees.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.990
I can see why that Chirin 
kid didn't wanna come here.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.260
Welcome home, Master Chin.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.470
Mr. Ichiryu spoke of new challengers

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.770
Honor the Food

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.770
for the temple treasure 
and this must be them.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:42.870
Correct, Shoji.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.370
My name is Shu, not Shoji.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.910
I'll introduce you.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.610
This is Tome and Julie.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:49.780
No, it isn't!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.750
You're getting even further off-base!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.380
It's Toriko and Komatsu!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.790
He's this temple's assistant instructor.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.550
You're not even listening...

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.160
Shokichi...

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.360
It's Shu, Master Chin.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.590
I'm going to have

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.660
Assistant Instructor Schwarz here continue 
with your Honor the Food training.

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:12.200
Schwa-chan, show them to the main hall.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.530
I, Shu, will take you there,

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.300
Toriko-san of the Four 
Kings and Chef Komatsu-san.

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.340
I may not be up to the task,

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.810
but I'm looking forward to working with you.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:26.280
If we really have to do this, I'd rather 
be taught directly by the Master...

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.580
You think I'm not up to it?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.120
Well, didn't you just say that yourself?!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.920
We already have the basics 
of Honoring the Food down

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:39.730
and don't have all the time in the 
world to get the Bubble Fruit.

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.200
On top of that,

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:46.570
there's Spoon, the technique the Master 
used to grab hold of those flames.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:49.470
It's the first time I saw a 
delicate technique like that.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.870
If that's a secret technique 
of Honoring the Food,

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.680
then I definitely wanna be taught 
by the one who can use it.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:01.180
However, the Master's training 
is particularly tough.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:04.180
I don't know if your bodies would hold 
up if you're suddenly thrown into it...

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:06.190
Tough?

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:08.190
Yes. Actually,

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:12.320
you two have already received the 
training baptism from the Master.

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:13.460
Baptism?

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:14.490
Yes.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:20.670
The 50-meter-class mountain that plummeted 
down Death Falls and right at you...

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:23.840
The Master scooped that out.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.780
The Master threw that mountain at us?!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.450
Is that true?!

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:37.450
I forgot about that...

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.590
Hey, it's nothin' to laugh about!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:44.720
Sorry about surprising you 
with that. At the time, um...

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.390
Why would you do something like that?!

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:49.630
Actually,

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:54.500
the President requested that I helped 
train you from some time back.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.770
The old man?!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:20:00.000
To get our feet wet, so to speak, I 
gave you a test at that waterfall.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.670
T-Test?! What kind of test is that?!

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.480
We nearly died!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:08.080
But you got through it somehow.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.910
You fellows were amazing.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.480
We <i>barely</i> made it!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.480
What would you have done if we'd died?!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.450
If you'd died, there wouldn't 
be anything else to do.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:22.190
It would've meant that you 
weren't worthy of my training.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:27.600
This guy is scary...

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.800
A-And he doesn't even remember our names...

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:34.470
I think that maybe even our 
lives are nothing to him...

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.840
I was right...

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.980
That missing chunk of forest 
with the Fortune Roll...

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.980
I bet the Master did scoop it out.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.380
Did I do that?

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.380
He ain't delicate in the least...

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.420
This guy's got a way over 
the top personality...

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:53.860
So who would you like to 
train with, me or the Master?

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.890
Shu-san, please!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.600
Do your very best.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:02.700
As soon as you master Honoring the Food,

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.530
I'll teach you Gourmet Secret Techniques.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:15.780
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:23.550
The world is spinning

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.820
A dream flower

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.460
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:39.630
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.700
Lead me by the hand

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:47.040
And take me with you

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:54.480
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:58.080
Red shoes

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:01.620
I can't take off

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:12.870
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:17.900
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:22.880
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.150
Hiding Level
2

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.950
Yun's Hiding Level is 2!

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:28.980
The allotted time limit is ten seconds!

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:31.280
Are you ready, everyone?

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:34.320
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.960
Today, the difficulty level is 
2, so it's on the easy side.

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:43.600
Well, can you find Yun?

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:48.430
Yun is... right here!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:56.640
Well? Was it easy today?

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:59.710
For the difficulty level here, 
there will be peaks and valleys.

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:02.450
With Toriko's training too, there 
are mountain peaks and valleys.

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:04.750
Now on to the next segment!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.880
It's unbelievable, everyone. I'm not sure I believe my own ears.

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:12.760
Toriko has admitted defeat for the first time ever!

00:23:13.020 --> 00:23:16.790
Toriko Totally Defeated?! The Delicate and Dynamic Power of Honoring the Food!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.930
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
